</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/e68fecaa-949c-11f1-a18f-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-08-09T023330Z-1111251841-RC2QUMAS1SUG-RTRMADP-3-WW2-ANNIVERSARY-NAGASAKI.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/e68fecaa-949c-11f1-a18f-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-08-09T023330Z-1111251841-RC2QUMAS1SUG-RTRMADP-3-WW2-ANNIVERSARY-NAGASAKI.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">ecfce6ce-949c-11f1-89e0-cdab0177e33c</guid><pubDate>Mon, 10 Aug 2026 09:22:07 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/e68fecaa-949c-11f1-a18f-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-08-09T023330Z-1111251841-RC2QUMAS1SUG-RTRMADP-3-WW2-ANNIVERSARY-NAGASAKI.jpg">REUTERS - Manami Yamada</source><dc:creator>东京特约记者 楚良一</dc:creator></item><item><category>要闻分析</category><title>上将断层 中将治军？</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/cn/%E4%B8%93%E6%A0%8F%E6%A3%80%E7%B4%A2/%E8%A6%81%E9%97%BB%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90/20260808-%E4%B8%8A%E5%B0%86%E6%96%AD%E5%B1%82-%E4%B8%AD%E5%B0%86%E6%B2%BB%E5%86%9B</link><description>
