</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/44f383c0-923f-11f1-a474-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-08-06T182909Z-1939966924-RC2ZSMANRJTH-RTRMADP-3-WW2-ANNIVERSARY-HIROSHIMA.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/44f383c0-923f-11f1-a474-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-08-06T182909Z-1939966924-RC2ZSMANRJTH-RTRMADP-3-WW2-ANNIVERSARY-HIROSHIMA.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">c94adfd4-923e-11f1-b62d-c9b100b5e473</guid><pubDate>Fri, 07 Aug 2026 09:07:30 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/44f383c0-923f-11f1-a474-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-08-06T182909Z-1939966924-RC2ZSMANRJTH-RTRMADP-3-WW2-ANNIVERSARY-HIROSHIMA.jpg">REUTERS - Issei Kato</source><dc:creator>东京特约记者 楚良一</dc:creator></item><item><category>亚洲</category><title>泰国学校发生枪击案 共造成8人死亡</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/cn/%E4%BA%9A%E6%B4%B2/20260807-%E6%B3%B0%E5%9B%BD%E5%AD%A6%E6%A0%A1%E5%8F%91%E7%94%9F%E6%9E%AA%E5%87%BB%E6%A1%88-%E5%85%B1%E9%80%A0%E6%88%908%E4%BA%BA%E6%AD%BB%E4%BA%A1</link><description>
